@startuml SystemArchitecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Sub-leasing Management System - System Architecture

package "Client Tier" {
  [Web Admin Portal\n(React + Vite)] as WebAdmin
  [Mobile App\n(React Native / Expo)] as MobileApp
}

package "Server Tier" {
  [Backend API\n(Spring Boot, MVC2)] as Backend
}

package "Database Tier" {
  database "Relational DB\n(MySQL/PostgreSQL)" as DB
}

package "External Systems" {
  [Payment Gateway /\nBank Webhook (VietQR)] as Payment
  [Cloudinary\n(File/Image Storage)] as Cloudinary
  [Expo Push\nNotification Service] as Push
  [OCR / Extraction\nLibrary] as OCR
}

WebAdmin --> Backend : REST/HTTPS (JWT)
MobileApp --> Backend : REST/HTTPS (JWT)
Backend --> DB : JDBC / JPA
Backend --> Payment : Create payment / receive webhook
Backend --> Cloudinary : Upload/retrieve files
Backend --> Push : Send push notification
Backend --> OCR : Extract contract/meter data

@enduml
